# libbw_audio.dylib is BUILD OUTPUT (staged here by a macOS build of this repo, and by CI when it
# packs the UPM tarball) - never committed. Its .meta file IS committed: a package installed from
# a registry is immutable, so the plugin's import settings (macOS universal, Editor on) cannot be
# fixed in the Inspector afterwards - they have to ship. See tools/upm/gen-meta.ps1.
*.dylib
!.gitkeep
!*.dylib.meta
